{
  "comment": "Frozen post-alpha package boundary rules from ADR-0018 (BR-011/BR-012). Enforced by tools/architecture-check/check.ts via `bun run architecture:check`. Changes require an ADR. allowedBundarPackages encodes the TARGET state; transitional exceptions below bridge until their expiry tasks close.",
